export anchor LineHeight:
    description:
        Sets the height of each line of text. A unitless number is multiplied by the component's own font size.

    identifier: lineHeight

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `line-height` property.

    values:
        - `normal`
        - `<number>`
        - `<length>`
        - `<percentage>`

    initial: normal

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            lineHeight: 1.5
        \\\
        ```
